      "lines":[{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"happy","text":"這張拍得不錯耶。"},{"speakerId":"player","expression":"thinking","text":"妳剛剛不是還叫我拍好看一點。"},{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"happy","text":"所以有拍好看啊。"},{"speakerId":"player","expression":"neutral","text":"好啦。"},{"speakerId":"mio","expression":"happy","text":"走吧，再去看看其他地方。"}],
